affirm his convictions to us  as an audience his dynamic with hayatawa  acts as a convenient mechanism for the  audience to learn more about this world  as denji unaware of the broader details  of his new fiend status and this world's  rules really can ask all the necessary  questions for which aki can answer the  paneling depicting their living  situation and their various interactions  are hilariously handled with page turns  reaction panels and full-blown clean  layouts serving the purpose of  delivering a joke like few i've ever  seen and that's another thing where  dragon ball in one piece got a giggle  out of me here and there chainsaw man  had me literally bursting out in  stitches constantly which let me tell  you never happens however i think this  opening section's strongest narrative  component was its choice to have this  line in chapter three where denji  recognizes that his life isn't going to  be worth much if he's already achieved  his goal of getting off the streets and  eating relatively well he sees people  like hayakawa driven by retribution  makima driven by  [Music]  this is denji's new goal my friends and  this is where a new character called  power comes screaming into the story  [Music]  power is the perfect yin to denji's yang  while also sharing so many things in  common with him and her introductory  story with the group is on its face  utterly silly with denji effectively  trying to win power's favor to touch her  chest however what spawns from this is  oddly and surprisingly brilliant however  before i talk about all of that i need  to talk about tatsuki fujimoto's  character designs because wow are these  brilliant designs when one starts  designing a character one of the most  important aspects to keep in mind is how  this design will serve to communicate to  a reader who this character is just at a  glance denji as a character is quite  unassuming and simple and his character  design reflects that very reality hajime  izayama took a 